<title>UK: Barratt year profits up at 52.1 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Barratt year profits up at 52.1 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		17.8		   vs 15.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 5.5		    vs 5.0</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 8.25		   vs 7.50</p>
<p> Pretax		     52.1		   vs 47.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   634.3		  vs 579</p>
<p>NOTE-Barratt Developments Plc is a major UK housebuilder.  </p>
<p> Operating result	 58.7		   vs 54.6</p>
<p> Interest payable	 6.7		    vs 6.9</p>
<p> Tax			  16.5		   vs 17.9</p>
<p> Attributable	     35.6		   vs 29.2</p>
<p> Pay date		   November 11</p>
<p> Div registration date  October 15</p>
<p> Ex-div date		October 7</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
